<title>INDIA: Diesel cars drive growth at India's Mahindra Ford.</title>
<headline>Diesel cars drive growth at India's Mahindra Ford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Diesel Escorts have become the number one seller for India's Mahindra Ford Ltd, leading the company to launch a limited edition of its petrol model, a senior executive said on Friday.</p>
<p>Mahindra Ford is a 50:50 joint venture between Ford Motor Co and Mahindr and Mahindr</p>
